5877..5953 Comment "/// Function extensionality from a homotopy, through the path space: the map"
5954..6028 Comment "/// takes a point to both functions\' results there and the homotopy\'s path"
6029..6105 Comment "/// between them. Its first end reads the first result, a returned call, and"
6106..6180 Comment "/// a returned call is the call it holds, so the end is `f`; the second is"
6181..6189 Comment "/// `g`."
